desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detect Hardcoded Password Assignment"
	title_zh: "检测硬编码密码赋值",
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-secret-password-assignment"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测 Detect Hardcoded Password Assignment 相关的风险模式。

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问系统或服务。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
False-positive hardening: require keyword immediately before =/:=; skip $-vars, concat (+...), HTML type=password, and getenv.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量、密钥管理服务或安全配置中心，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://App.java": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secret-password-assignment
POS
	"safefile://AppSafe.java": <<<NEG
public class AppSafe {
  String password = System.getenv("DB_PASSWORD");
  String password = "$pass";
  String secret = "+secret+";
}
NEG
	"safefile://form.html": <<<NEGHTML
<label>password</label><input type="password" name="password" />
NEGHTML
)

${*}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:(?i)\b(password|passwd|pwd|secret|api[_-]?key|access[_-]?key)\b\s*[:=]\s*["'](?![\$+])[^"'\s]{3,}["'])|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secret\-password\-assignment/, /(?i)getenv\s*\(/, /(?i)type\s*=\s*["']password["']/, /(?i)TYPE\s*=\s*["']?char/) as $out
alert $out for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Hardcoded Password-like Assignment",
	title_zh: "硬编码密码类赋值",
	message: "Literal secret-like assignment detected",
}
